      [130] = {n="Desert Rain I (Attohwa)",r=1,d="Client: Resistance Sapper (Central\n Outpost, Abyssea - Attohwa)\nSummary:\n The continual defense of the pulse\n martello has pushed our soldiers to\n the brink of exhaustion. This\n operation requires you to transport\n ensorceled battle provisions from the\n stockpile, using the enchanted sack\n provided. Be mindful that the sack\n does not rupture in the process."},
