      [136] = {n="Crimson Carpet I (Attohwa)",r=1,d="Client: Resistance Sapper (Central\n Outpost, Abyssea - Attohwa)\nSummary:\n Enfeeblement traps have been laid\n along the outpost's perimeter in order\n to weaken would-be besiegers. This\n operation requires you to infuse a\n rear trap with paralysis trap fluid, its\n energy source. Be mindful of your\n distance from the trap when\n performing the infusion."},
